	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE - Loss / temperature\nPair hot resistance estimate about 16.5mOhm (worst case VGS and derated with the graph) Use Rds(on) vs Tj graph as reference\nPpair = I^2 x R = 10^2 x 0.0165 = 1.65W\nR_jtoamb = 40°C/W => 1.65W * 40°C/W = 66°C + 55° (Poland, summer, hot metal box) = 121 °C < 175 °C \n\n\n"
